          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A turn-based JRPG and sequel to the then-Japan-only Earthbound Beginnings (1989) in which Ness, a young boy living in a land based on the USA, leaves home to go on an adventure through strange locations, get to know quirky characters, and defeat an unknowable alien threat called Giygas while facing up to the realities of growing up and becoming familiar with the real world.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Un JRPG por turnos y secuela de Earthbound Beginnings (1989), que entonces solo había salido en Japón. Ness, un niño que vive en una tierra inspirada en Estados Unidos, abandona su hogar para emprender una aventura por lugares extraños, conocer a personajes excéntricos y derrotar a una amenaza alienígena indescifrable llamada Giygas, mientras afronta las realidades de crecer y de familiarizarse con el mundo real.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1994",
          "source": "igdb",
