        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A turn-based JRPG and sequel to EarthBound (1994) in which a tragedy surrounding a family in the primitive yet joyful village of Tazmily incites the coming-of-age story of Lucas, the family's younger son, who goes on perilous adventures along with his friends in order to find his missing brother and stop a group of masked men from bringing about the end of the world.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Un JRPG por turnos y secuela de EarthBound (1994), en el que una tragedia que afecta a una familia en la primitiva pero alegre aldea de Tazmily da pie a la historia de maduración de Lucas, el hijo menor de la familia. Lucas emprende peligrosas aventuras junto a sus amigos para encontrar a su hermano desaparecido y detener a un grupo de hombres enmascarados que pretende provocar el fin del mundo.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
